  "description": "A security-first SDK for bridging PC modding toolchains with console game engines.\n      Provides a three-gate validation firewall (Deserialize, Boundary Guards, Audit Logger)\n      that sanitizes untrusted mod payloads before they reach the trusted console runtime.",
  "id": "BridgeMod.SDK",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-10T03:03:59.383Z",
