  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.5.0 — Procedural Control Layer\n\n      New Features:\n      • BridgeRandom — Deterministic Xorshift32 PRNG with seed-based reproducibility\n      • ProceduralWeightTable — Named weight normalization with BridgeConfig boundary guards\n      • PROCEDURAL_GEN_001 audit code — Logs when BridgeRandom is initialized\n\n      New Namespaces:\n      • BridgeMod.Bridge.Procedural — Home for procedural generation types\n\n      Quality:\n      • 100/100 tests passing (85 existing + 15 Phase 4 procedural tests)\n      • 0 compiler warnings in Release configuration\n      • Determinism guarantee extended to procedural control layer\n      • Backward compatible: all 85 pre-existing tests pass unmodified\n\n      Design:\n      • Xorshift32: pure bit-shifting, no platform libs, cross-runtime portable\n      • Weight normalization: clamp via BridgeConfig, then divide by sum\n      • Audit logging: optional BridgeRandom logger parameter for reproducibility tracking",
